# Sony DualSense Wireless Controller
# Global calibration with minimal deadzones
# Applied at system level, affects all games/applications

# Minimal deadzone configuration (extremely small - 2%)
# Prevents phantom touches without impacting sensitivity
DualSense Wireless Controller
# Left stick (X/Y - primary movement)
evdev ABS_X 2  # 2% deadzone on left stick X
evdev ABS_Y 2  # 2% deadzone on left stick Y

# Right stick (Rx/Ry - camera)
evdev ABS_RX 2  # 2% deadzone on right stick X (horizontal)
evdev ABS_RY 2  # 2% deadzone on right stick Y (vertical)

# Alternative calibration using joystick utility
# This file can be used with jscalibrator or similar tools
# To test: jstest /dev/input/js0
# To recalibrate: jscalibrator --device /dev/input/js0 --calibrate
